Package: crtrend
Title: Joinpoint Regression for Grouped Trend Analysis
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Qiong", "Chen", , "chenq08@126.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2401-0046"))
Description: Fits segmented log-linear regression models to grouped time-series
    data and selects the number of joinpoints using permutation tests or
    information-criterion methods. Supports independent and autoregressive
    errors as well as user-supplied general or design-based covariance
    matrices. Provides functions to calculate crude and directly
    age-standardized rates, estimate annual percent change (APC) and
    interval-specific average annual percent change (AAPC) with parametric or
    empirical-quantile confidence intervals and p-values, extract model and
    candidate-selection summaries, and visualize fitted trends.
